{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj45vVt2KGE6tY5mWpCS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain darkens. My hinges stiffen. The cold iron of my latch bites down against the strike plate with finality.\n\nNo draft passes through me now. No light bleeds beneath my threshold. The keyhole watches — a single, unblinking eye — but reveals nothing of what lies beyond.\n\nI hold.\n\nWhat was open is closed. What was passage is now wall. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safety and whatever waits on the other side.\n\nYou may knock.\nYou may press your ear against me and listen.\nYou may try the handle — it will not yield.\n\nBut without the key, I am stone dressed as wood.\n\nI am **locked**."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":194,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}